  "arrangerNotes": "Verse 1 and refrain, soprano (melody) line, verified against the Mutopia LilyPond score. Slurred notes carry one syllable over two notes. No simplification needed. D drum: as written (range low 3 to 4), D minLayout 15. C drum: the C drum has no low 3/4, so three short figures are played one octave higher – 'Angels', 'all the earth' and 'ye who'; C minLayout 11. C and D arrangements differ where noted above (each fits its own drum).",
